            "review_title": "Review at Yakiniku Yazawa Saigon",
            "review_text": "fabio n\nHauterive, Switzerland21 contributions\n0\nAccueil, qualité, perfection\nJan 2026 • Friends\nThis restaurant is simply incredible. With my friend we have enjoyed our dinner, The restaurant's atmosphere represents the best of what Japan has to offer. The meat was fresh and tasted amazing. The quality and the welcome easily exceed our Swiss standards. A special thank to our server Mai Huong Tian who demonstrated the quality of Vietnamese hospitality, it was a real dream! We will definitely return, an address to keep in mind!\nRead more\nWritten January 28, 2026",
