            "review_text": "Bus Driver\nHong Kong, China98 contributions\n0\nEverything was amazing\nJul 2025 • Couples\nThis is our second time here since my girlfriend and I were here for our first anniversary. She will never forget this restaurant and how impressed she was with the wagyu beef. Service was excellent, and the staff was friendly and very polite. However, some of them might need to improve a bit of English, at least the mandatory part while introducing the wagyu to the customers, because some staff I really barely understand, but still, no point was deducted from this restaurant. Definitely come back again.\nRead more\nWritten July 19, 2025",
