            "review_title": "Review at Yakiniku Yazawa Saigon",
            "review_text": "ethan\nJapan23 contributions\n0\nThe best Wagyu yakiniku restaurant in Vietnam\nNov 2024 • Friends\nThe interior is quite luxurious and stylish, so nice that you forget you are in Vietnam.\n A popular menu item is the Yazawa-yaki, thinly sliced sirloin served with a special egg and yam sauce. Other fresh meat items on the menu include Wagyu Yukke and Meat Sushi. Most of this Wagyu beef is flown in from Japan, not frozen, through a proprietary route. YAZAWA seems to be the only restaurant in Vietnam that offers Wagyu beef in chilled form, and it is wonderful to be able to enjoy such delicious meat in Vietnam.\nRead more\nWritten April 19, 2025",
