            "review_text": "VWYUNG\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nOmakase Yakiniku\nJul 2019 • Friends\nFrom wagyu sashimi to BBQ, all the meat at this restaurant was fresh and melt-in-your-mouth delicious! I didn't not expect to experience such fine dining at a Yakiniku restaurant but the service and food was impeccable. \nA little on the pricey side compared to other Yakiniku restaurants in Saigon but you are getting real value for the beef instead of quantity. Highly recommended for other meat lovers to try this restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 20, 2019",
